    "    \"  2. Instantiate OptimisationSimulation.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"  3. Discover, select and apply outputs.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"  4. Define ACCIM custom-model parameters.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"  5. Define and run the optimisation problem.\\n\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
